# =====================================================================
# Release V153 -- Patient_Data_Quality: effectively-active = appointment in last 2 years
# =====================================================================
# Refine Gold.Dim_Patient_Data_Quality so a patient only counts as "orphaned by an inactive
# practitioner" if they are effectively ACTIVE -- active flag AND at least one appointment (any
# status) within the last 2 years. Patients dormant >2yr are treated as inactive, so their
# orphaned-practitioner rows drop out (removes the spurious long-departed dentist-orphan rows).
# Adds an EXISTS on Gold.Fact_Appointments to the pat CTE; view + PBI view regen only, no change
# to output columns and no data change elsewhere.
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V153__patient_data_quality_2yr_active.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY   Fabric\Gold.Dim_Patient_Data_Quality.View.sql
EXEC     EXEC Meta.usp_Create_Gold_Views;

TEST
